# A rejected key must NOT be laundered into ConnectionState.failed (banshee-dqh), which
# renders as "Nothing is watching" — false when the daemon is healthy, sampling and
# recording alerts, and only this client is locked out. The two states are opposite
# claims about the machine and send the user to different actions.
#
# This pin lives in the MODEL because the client-side tests cannot reach it: they prove
# APIClient throws .unauthorized, not that the model preserves the distinction on the
# way to the UI. Verified 2026-09-06 that this mutation is NOT caught by any
# APIClient test.
file: swift/Sources/BansheeCore/PressureModel.swift
test: testARejectedKeyIsDistinctFromAnUnreachableDaemon
